verifyCodeAction / signInVerifyAction returned `leadId` (student_leads.id) in the server-action response. No page
uses it, and because lead_intake merges on phone, comparing the id returned for someone else's phone with the id of
a lead just created for a fresh number tells whether that phone was already an Eduwit lead. The id stays server-side
(the log still records whether a lead was written).

