Decisions (owner approval of 31 Oct): site-wide code ceiling, lead writes for leads not tied to the verified student,
outbox worker only when due and the 30 s poll timeout, daily Witty ceiling, no email in the model's input. Runbook:
the two new settings in the flags table, the jobs row, two incident rows, web14's own rollback, and web14 in the
go-live migration range.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N9g7Xn7RWKaJF173G8V173
